    <div class="mgdb-hero-body">
      <p class="mgdb-hero-stamp"><span aria-hidden="true">&#9679;</span> Updated&#58; $(data_date)</p>
      <h1 id="flints-title">European Flint Reference Genomes &amp; Heterosis Framework</h1>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-description">
        De novo chromosome-scale genome assemblies, annotations, and structural variation maps for four cornerstone European flint inbred lines \(DK105, EP1, F7, PE0075\) to uncover cold-tolerance adaptations and dent &times; flint heterosis.
      </p>

      <div class="flints-hero-actions-row">
        <a class="flints-hero-link" href="/genomebrowser">
          <span class="flints-link-dot flints-dot-green" aria-hidden="true"></span> Explore in JBrowse 2 &#8599;
        </a>
        <a class="flints-hero-link" href="http://www.europeanmaize.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="flints-link-dot flints-dot-gold" aria-hidden="true"></span> European Maize Portal &#8599;
        </a>
        <a class="flints-hero-link" href="/download#downloads-flints">
