        </a>
        <a class="flints-hero-link" href="https://doi.org/10.1038/s41588-020-0671-9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="flints-link-dot flints-dot-rose" aria-hidden="true"></span> Nature Genetics Paper &#8599;
        </a>
        <a class="flints-hero-link" href="/gene_center/gene">
