      <div>
        <h2 id="flints-hosted-title" class="mgdb-panel-title">European Flint Data Hosted at MaizeGDB</h2>
        <p class="mgdb-panel-lead">Integrated tools, browsers, BLAST databases, and sequence downloads available across the MaizeGDB ecosystem.</p>
